    {
      "id": 400,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Dashboard Overview",
      "description": "High-level overview of what this dashboard measures and why it matters to leadership, delivery teams, and developers.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "content": "## GitHub Copilot User, Team & Cohort Deep Insights\n\nThis dashboard focuses on who is using Copilot, how users are distributed across teams and cohorts, and where the deepest usage patterns appear.\n\n**Leadership:** understand where adoption is concentrated and which cohorts may need enablement.  \n**Teams:** compare membership, feature usage, and model / language preferences.  \n**Developers:** identify champion users, strong usage patterns, and areas where adoption can grow.\n\nUse this dashboard to answer: **Which users and teams are most engaged, which cohorts are maturing, and where can enablement create more value?**\n",
        "mode": "markdown"
      }
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_VICTORIAMETRICS}"
      },
      "description": "Number of unique users seen in the selected time range. Useful for measuring total user reach.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "decimals": 0,
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "#d08cff",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "none"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "id": 401,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "count(max by (user_login) (max_over_time(github_copilot_user_daily_record{enterprise=\"$enterprise\"}[$__range])))",
          "instant": true,
